## Scan Execution Checklist

| Recipe | Hits |
|--------|------|
| `.ToLower()`/`.ToUpper()` | 2 (L97, L103) |
| `.All()`/`.Any()` on string | 2 (L93, L101) |
| LINQ `.Select`/`.Cast`/`.Aggregate` | 5 (L85, L89, L171, L214) |
| `params` array allocation | 1 (L213) |
| `.Replace(` | 1 (L187) |
